  "agent": {
    "note": "**STRESS 07/10 — 07-quantum-collapse** (gate-36 stress set for `@m0saic/media/scroll_wall/v1`).\n\nA CANVAS THAT COLLAPSES THE PRECISION LATTICE at 1913x1069. 1913x1069 — both dimensions prime-ish, so the lattice quantum `q` falls to 1 and every geometry number stops being a coarse multiple. That is the documented degradation: the geometry stays CORRECT and pays in precision, blowing the m0 string out to roughly 47k characters. Three rows on top of it. Watch: it renders; the rows are even; the gaps are uniform; note the encoder rounds odd dimensions down to even (1912x1068) — that is h264, not the template.",
    "question": "Pass or fail? Note anything off and I'll fix + re-mint this variant."
  },
